{"id":"4884f45058a56aac","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-integral.md","title":"Integral","display":"df-integral — Integral","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-integral","aliases":["58-df-integral","Integral"],"display":"df-integral — Integral","depends_on":["[[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-integral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-integral</span><span>Integral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-integral — Integral"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md\">../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_+\">\\(\\mathcal B_+\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,\\infty]\">\\([0,\\infty]\\)</span> 上的 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7f96c502a4a99a46\" href=\"?note=7f96c502a4a99a46\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md\">../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in{}^X[0,\\infty]\">\\(f\\in{}^X[0,\\infty]\\)</span> 且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\\)</span>\n（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_Ef\\,d\\mu\">\\(\\int_Ef\\,d\\mu\\)</span>（本文件定义的非负 Lebesgue 积分）</li>\n<li>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,\\infty]\">\\([0,\\infty]\\)</span> 中，非负乘法采用下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\odot\">\\(\\odot\\)</span>；有限和与可数和均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,\\infty]\">\\([0,\\infty]\\)</span> 中计算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}u_n=\\sup_{N\\in\\omega}\\sum_{n&lt;N}u_n\">\\(\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}u_n=\\sup_{N\\in\\omega}\\sum_{n&lt;N}u_n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_A\">\\(\\mathbf1_A\\)</span> 为在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\setminus A\">\\(X\\setminus A\\)</span> 上等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的函数图。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S(\\mathcal B_+)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S(\\mathcal B_+)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in[0,\\infty]\\quad\na\\odot b\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&amp;a=0\\lor b=0,\\\\\nab,&amp;0&lt;a,b&lt;\\infty,\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;a,b&gt;0\\land(a=\\infty\\lor b=\\infty).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in[0,\\infty]\\quad\na\\odot b\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&amp;a=0\\lor b=0,\\\\\nab,&amp;0&lt;a,b&lt;\\infty,\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;a,b&gt;0\\land(a=\\infty\\lor b=\\infty).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}integral} \\vdash\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S(\\mathcal B_+)\\land\n\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)\\land\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\\land\nE\\in\\mathcal F\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\int_Ef\\,d\\mu=\n\\sup\\left\\{\n\\sum_{i&lt;n}a_i\\odot\\mu(E\\cap A_i)\n\\middle|\nn\\in\\omega\\land a\\in[0,\\infty)^n\\land A\\in\\mathcal F^n\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\\sum_{i&lt;n}a_i\\mathbf 1_{A_i}(x)\\leq f(x)\\right)\n\\right\\}\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}integral} \\vdash\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\n\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeBorel}_S(\\mathcal B_+)\\land\n\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)\\land\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\\land\nE\\in\\mathcal F\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\int_Ef\\,d\\mu=\n\\sup\\left\\{\n\\sum_{i&lt;n}a_i\\odot\\mu(E\\cap A_i)\n\\middle|\nn\\in\\omega\\land a\\in[0,\\infty)^n\\land A\\in\\mathcal F^n\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\left(\\sum_{i&lt;n}a_i\\mathbf 1_{A_i}(x)\\leq f(x)\\right)\n\\right\\}\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lebesgue integral: limit of simple functions</li>\n<li>单调收敛、支配收敛与变量替换都需要各自的可测性、支配或非奇异性假设，属于后续定理而非本定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Folland, Real Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d